uired_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cOne of the most nuanced and thoughtful strategy games I've played in a long time.\u201d<br>IGN<br><br>\u201c2025 isn't even over yet and I've already played my best game of 2026...\u201d<br>Jeuxvideo<br><br>\u201cIf the [game] can maintain the level of the first 30 hours of gameplay, my game of the year 2026 is already decided before the year has even begun.\u201d<br> GameStar<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/b76bf94de0b466797f9455a6da347507020a9966/ss_b76bf94de0b466797f9455a6da347507020a9966.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/b76bf94de0b466797f9455a6da347507020a9966/ss_b76bf94de0b466797f9455a6da347507020a9966.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/a49301637adf55a2fad26305272829a0f47b478d/ss_a49301637adf55a2fad26305272829a0f47b478d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/a49301637adf55a2fad26305272829a0f47b478d/ss_a49301637adf55a2fad26305272829a0f47b478d.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/129c23d40964c3f0a7e766182179333a19f422b9/ss_129c23d40964c3f0a7e766182179333a19f422b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/129c23d40964c3f0a7e766182179333a19f422b9/ss_129c23d40964c3f0a7e766182179333a19f422b9.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/54d33c8cd2e23c2a278367b487449077d5f0bc49/ss_54d33c8cd2e23c2a278367b487449077d5f0bc49.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/54d33c8cd2e23c2a278367b487449077d5f0bc49/ss_54d33c8cd2e23c2a278367b487449077d5f0bc49.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/99ad52d7d60acd283b9c1dc361324de70ed9f8f1/ss_99ad52d7d60acd283b9c1dc361324de70ed9f8f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/99ad52d7d60acd283b9c1dc361324de70ed9f8f1/ss_99ad52d7d60acd283b9c1dc361324de70ed9f8f1.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/4277d9253ea2360418937a3250c8954e2378a510/ss_4277d9253ea2360418937a3250c8954e2378a510.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/4277d9253ea2360418937a3250c8954e2378a510/ss_4277d9253ea2360418937a3250c8954e2378a510.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/8b1fd57290c17bb1e326cc9be4da53a2bb4fa252/ss_8b1fd57290c17bb1e326cc9be4da53a2bb4fa252.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/8b1fd57290c17bb1e326cc9be4da53a2bb4fa252/ss_8b1fd57290c17bb1e326cc9be4da53a2bb4fa252.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/3ec3dbbe03b62fe1367fb445ab1fc5ba23467da4/ss_3ec3dbbe03b62fe1367fb445ab1fc5ba23467da4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/3ec3dbbe03b62fe1367fb445ab1fc5ba23467da4/ss_3ec3dbbe03b62fe1367fb445ab1fc5ba23467da4.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/2b1f8ec2befd90418edd6d1c154bd494ba066821/ss_2b1f8ec2befd90418edd6d1c154bd494ba066821.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/2b1f8ec2befd90418edd6d1c154bd494ba066821/ss_2b1f8ec2befd90418edd6d1c154bd494ba066821.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/d8fca4059f3f9494d35c2ae50399a28b303fa3b3/ss_d8fca4059f3f9494d35c2ae50399a28b303fa3b3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/d8fca4059f3f9494d35c2ae50399a28b303fa3b3/ss_d8fca4059f3f9494d35c2ae50399a28b303fa3b3.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/e22deae60cc21553edcaacca0953aa41128051bb/ss_e22deae60cc21553edcaacca0953aa41128051bb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/e22deae60cc21553edcaacca0953aa41128051bb/ss_e22deae60cc21553edcaacca0953aa41128051bb.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/90616f848a23afca914b08c594aa6d57ff0c592e/ss_90616f848a23afca914b08c594aa6d57ff0c592e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/90616f848a23afca914b08c594aa6d57ff0c592e/ss_90616f848a23afca914b08c594aa6d57ff0c592e.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/7042e4e52692045ec4d8293d7accef5139f51949/ss_7042e4e52692045ec4d8293d7accef5139f51949.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/7042e4e52692045ec4d8293d7accef5139f51949/ss_7042e4e52692045ec4d8293d7accef5139f51949.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/066deee756369d605bb850f16606713119fb1876/ss_066deee756369d605bb850f16606713119fb1876.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/066deee756369d605bb850f16606713119fb1876/ss_066deee756369d605bb850f16606713119fb1876.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"},{"id":14,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/551803fdbc7c68d474e065fa9843e541493f64aa/ss_551803fdbc7c68d474e065fa9843e541493f64aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769602738","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686060/551803fdbc7c68d474e065fa9843e541493f64aa/ss_551803fdbc7c68d474e065fa9843e541493f64aa.600x338.jpg?t=1769602738"}],"short_description":"Build the ultimate cat army through tactical breeding and send them into deep, challenging turn-based adventures. Draft abilities, collect items, and manipulate genetics across generations in this roguelike tactics game from the creators of The Binding of Isaac and The End is Nigh.","steam_appid":686060,"support_info":{"email":"support@glaielgames.com","url":"https://discord.gg/mewgenics"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":"http://mewgenics.com/"}